1
00:05:03,333 --> 00:05:09,333
Hollywood's all-American boy had a secret.

2
00:10:06,666 --> 00:10:12,666
Tab Hunter Confidential is a documentary film directed by Jeffrey Schwarz.

3
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Throughout the 1950s, Tab Hunter reigned as
Hollywood’s ultimate male heartthrob.

4
00:20:13,333 --> 00:20:19,333
But throughout his years of stardom, Tab had a secret.

5
00:25:16,666 --> 00:25:22,666
Tab Hunter was gay, and spent his Hollywood years in a precarious closet
that repeatedly threatened to implode and destroy him.

6
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:26,000
Tab Hunter himself shares first hand, for the first time, what it was like to be a studio manufactured movie star during the
Golden Age of Hollywood and the consequences of being someone totally different from his studio manufactured image.

7
00:35:23,333 --> 00:35:29,333
Self, played by Tab Hunter.

8
00:40:26,666 --> 00:40:32,666
Self, played by Debbie Reynolds.

9
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:36,000
Self, played by Robert Wagner.

10
00:50:33,333 --> 00:50:39,333
Self, played by John Waters.

11
00:55:36,666 --> 00:55:42,666
Self, played by George Takei.

12
01:00:40,000 --> 01:00:46,000
Self, played by Clint Eastwood.

13
01:05:43,333 --> 01:05:49,333
Tab Hunter Confidential is a 2015 American documentary film focusing
on the American actor, singer, and author Tab Hunter.

14
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
It is inspired by his autobiography of the same name.

15
01:15:50,000 --> 01:15:56,000
The film was produced by Allan Glaser and directed by Jeffrey Schwarz.

16
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
The film features extensive interviews with Hunter, as well as contemporaries and
associates, including John Waters, Clint Eastwood, Debbie Reynolds, and more.

17
01:25:56,666 --> 01:26:02,666
The film explores themes of sexuality, biography, in the
closet, hollywood, based on memoir or autobiography.
